          "explanation": "Proactive QoE is a pricing strategy. Finding your own addbacks and defending them on your terms is more credible than a buyer discovering them during diligence. A well-prepared seller's QoE often results in a higher adjusted EBITDA - and therefore higher price - than leaving the analysis to a skeptical buyer."
