      "applicationExercise": "Model a 10% price increase scenario for a client's SaaS product: estimate the price elasticity based on historical renewal data, calculate the expected churn impact from the increase, model the net ARR impact across three elasticity scenarios (low, base, high), and determine the break-even churn rate at which the price increase is revenue-neutral. Present the recommendation with your base-case financial projections.",
